<https://w3id.org/morpholib/thompson/np/pred-crown-Scorpaenidae/assertion> {
    <https://w3id.org/morpholib/thompson/prediction/pred-crown-Scorpaenidae> a mlt:PhylogeneticMorphologyPrediction ;
        rdfs:label "Predicted body plan: Scorpaenidae at 55.4 Ma (crown-node ancestral body plan of a sampled family)" ;
        dcterms:description "Conditional expectation of the 17-landmark body planform of the Scorpaenidae lineage at 55.4 Ma given 13 sampled living species of the clade and 743 landmarked reef-fish species on the Rabosky et al. (2018) time tree. Crown-node ancestral body plan of a sampled family. Registered before any comparison with fossils of this age." ;
        mlt:ageMa 55.4 ;
        mlt:evolutionaryProcess "multivariate Pagel lambda (lambda = 0.959 for the Thompson modes, 0.924 for full shape), selected by AICc over white noise, Brownian motion, Ornstein-Uhlenbeck and Early Burst" ;
        mlt:expectedProcrustesRMSFull30 0.028 ;
        mlt:expectedProcrustesRMSThompson7 0.0305 ;
        mlt:falsificationCriterion "A well-preserved articulated fossil of Scorpaenidae dated to 55 +/- 11 Ma, lying on or near this lineage, with maximum body depth / standard length outside [0.309, 0.417] falsifies this prediction (point estimate 0.360); a 17-landmark Procrustes RMS to the predicted configuration much larger than the expected error at this horizon does likewise." ;
        mlt:hasPredictedRatio <https://w3id.org/morpholib/thompson/prediction/pred-crown-Scorpaenidae-full30-BD_over_SL>,
            <https://w3id.org/morpholib/thompson/prediction/pred-crown-Scorpaenidae-full30-BDmax_over_SL>,
            <https://w3id.org/morpholib/thompson/prediction/pred-crown-Scorpaenidae-full30-HL_over_SL>,
